# Signing key and its passwords. Ignored BEFORE the directory is created, so
# jj never snapshots it. Dot-prefixed so shell globs like `git add *` skip it.
# Losing this means no future build can upgrade an installed doobs; leaking it
# into this public repo means rotating it, with the same consequence.
.secrets/
